Subject: pinctrl: qcom: spmi-gpio: match PMIH010x

Register the documented 18-pin PMIH010x GPIO block so the ADC
thermistor pinctrl states can apply.

Signed-off-by: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/097c92ce69e530138a2afacb237d7acf4e12eb7c
---
 drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c b/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c
index c6f93fb1dc2027a697eeec0060761b58b9361256..530d7eb7fdefdb8c3a521b71d252492dbb8c46be 100644
--- a/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c
